cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this completed v0.3.0 matched-null study with the verified Zenodo DOI below. The v0.1.0 and v0.2.0 records, shared concept DOI, correction notice, and interpretation boundaries are documented in docs/ARCHIVAL_PROVENANCE.md."
title: "Does PCA Reveal or Fabricate Topological Structure in Omics Data? A Pre-Registered, Cross-Domain Replication with Matched Null Models"
authors:
  - family-names: Maniches
    given-names: Santiago
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-6480-1987"
    affiliation: "TOPOLOGICA LLC"
type: software
version: 0.3.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23290337"
date-released: 2026-10-10
abstract: "Computational research software and preserved evidence for cross-cohort PCA and persistent-homology analyses, including corrected 2026 statistical interpretations and the executed matched 110-tumor comparison of independent-feature and covariance-preserving nulls. This release makes no claim of an established biological topology mechanism."
repository-code: "https://github.com/smaniches/pca-topology-crossdomain-replication"
license: MIT
keywords:
